>                 </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11758]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Std dose</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>1500 \u2013 2500IU</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> of anti D</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11759]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>I/M</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>I/V </span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"8272121230ec907c79db0710\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-08-006\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 8272121230ec907c79db0710\" viewbox=\"619125 180975 990600 409575\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"13551dbf41b65f82108c9dc952c091f61e8e553ae60d0d2508182f83799e2355\"><g data-mm-object-id=\"885bd38ec8ca005e5bd0\" transform=\"translate(626745 196638)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0) translate(4127.5 177800) rotate(0) scale(-1 -1) translate(-4127.5 -177800)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 8255 355600\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#4472C4\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\"></path></g></g><g data-mm-object-id=\"d9dcd62fecac1e202a50\" transform=\"translate(1564640 196215)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0) translate(4127.5 177800) rotate(0) scale(-1 -1) translate(-4127.5 -177800)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 8255 355600\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#4472C4\" stroke